That's a genre.

00:46:16.060 --> 00:46:20.100
And you know, well, let's eat things

00:46:20.100 --> 00:46:22.103
from different places.

00:46:23.810 --> 00:46:27.800
I specifically remember,
we still do come up

00:46:27.800 --> 00:46:30.720
with some ideas, I specifically remember

00:46:30.720 --> 00:46:33.500
when the international food thing was

00:46:33.500 --> 00:46:34.470
Birthed?

00:46:34.470 --> 00:46:36.937
Birthed or pitched to us and it was like,

00:46:36.937 --> 00:46:38.737
"Hey, we're gonna play a game
where you guys eat something

00:46:38.737 --> 00:46:41.957
